-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The license above covers the code in this repository only. The following
components are downloaded at build time and remain under their own licenses.
Check each upstream project for the exact terms.

Machine learning models (apps/processor/Dockerfile)

  * InsightFace buffalo_l (SCRFD face detection, ArcFace recognition),
    ONNX export by Immich (huggingface.co/immich-app/buffalo_l).
    InsightFace's pretrained model weights are licensed for NON-COMMERCIAL
    RESEARCH PURPOSES ONLY. Face recognition in this project therefore must
    not be used commercially, even though the AGPL itself permits commercial
    use of the code. Build with NANA_FACES=off to leave these weights out of
    the image entirely (docs/deploy.md). See
    https://github.com/deepinsight/insightface.

  * OpenAI CLIP ViT-B/32 image encoder, int8 ONNX export by Xenova
    (huggingface.co/Xenova/clip-vit-base-patch32). MIT License.

Container software (Debian packages and npm)

  * libvips, libheif and its plugins, LibRaw, ExifTool, FFmpeg
    (Debian builds, each under its own GPL / LGPL / Artistic-style license).
  * ONNX Runtime (onnxruntime-node). MIT License.
  * cloudflared (device image only). Apache License 2.0.

Map data

  * Base map tiles are loaded by the browser from OpenFreeMap
    (https://openfreemap.org), based on OpenMapTiles and OpenStreetMap data
    (© OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL).
